# Float-typed local assigned an integer `div` (15, 16, 17, 18): the fraction is already gone
# Integer target (19), real division `/` (20, 21) and `*` (22) must not fire
# Known FP shape: `D := (A div B) * 1.0` is not flagged (rhs top operator is not div) -- no guess
integer-division-to-float 15
integer-division-to-float 16
integer-division-to-float 17
integer-division-to-float 18
!integer-division-to-float 19
!integer-division-to-float 20
!integer-division-to-float 21
!integer-division-to-float 22
